[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777108109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104846#issuecomment-2777108109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104846","id":2777108109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lh06N","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T22:12:51Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T22:12:51Z","body":"Have to find time to do a dive into this, but just on face value it's important to know that when environment adjustments are enabled, we stop rendering into the normal OpenXR buffers but instead render into an intermediate buffer, after which we get a copy post process that applies the color changes. This disables foveated rendering and introduces additional bandwidth which would greatly effect performance in a negative way so keep that in mind.\n\nOther than that, this is unlikely to be an issue specific to XR, so this should be tested on other mobile devices to see if this is more widely reproducible.\n\nI'm wondering if the cause here could be that either framebuffers or other such entities are created on the fly and leaking, or if we've got an issue with buffers being recreated instead of reused.\nIt would be good to get logcat output to see if errors are being logged when things go haywire, they may point us in the correct direction.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2777108109/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786679077","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104846#issuecomment-2786679077","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104846","id":2786679077,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mGVkl","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-08T14:38:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T19:24:02Z","body":"I did run MQDH log outputs during this as well as have the godot remote debugger attached and it just hard freezes without any real output that I could see however once frozen I closed the app instead of letting it crash ... I guess I could continue to capture logs until the application crashes? I'll also state that not using adjustments on the panorama sky no longer results in the issue. I'll also deploy the project without init on the xr module to my fire hd and see if I can repo without xrshaders and follow up. \n\n**Follow up:**\nWas able to deploy to my kindle fire HD and get the same behavior. Will follow up with any additional logging I can collect. Godot debugger outputs nothing that stands out and profiler continues capturing until crash with memory, vram looking stable. \nNon VR Reproduction - https://github.com/uno1982/GodotPanoramaSkyAdjustments\nLogCat Output - https://github.com/uno1982/GodotPanoramaSkyAdjustments/blob/master/logcat.txt","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2786679077/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2787454503","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104846#issuecomment-2787454503","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104846","id":2787454503,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mJS4n","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}"